{"step_index":781,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:36:41Z","thinking":"**Examining Nginx's Reuseport Behavior**\n\nThe Nginx process has been running for an extended period. This long uptime, combined with previous use of `reuseport` across different IPs, suggests that a simple reload might not fully update listening sockets. Considering the limitations with `reuseport`, it's possible reloads cannot remove/alter sockets without a full restart in specific configurations.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"03-map vhost explicitly binding to 172.30.198.33:9443 and 109.62.64.18:9443\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"# HTTPS Centreon MAP\\nserver {\\n    listen              172.30.198.33:9443 ssl http2;\\n    listen              109.62.64.18:9443 ssl http2;\\n    server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr 109.62.64.18;\\n\\n    # SSL (certificat dédié Let's Encrypt)\\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\\n\\n    # security\\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\\n\\n    # logging\\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\\n\\n    # Redirection explicite racine -> /centreon-map/\\n    location = / {\\n        return 301 /centreon-map/;\\n    }\\n\\n    # reverse proxy vers Map (Tomcat HTTPS sur port 9443)\\n    location / {\\n        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;\\n        proxy_ssl_verify           off;\\n\\n        include                    nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;\\n        proxy_set_header Host      $http_host;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\\n 